---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import company from '../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Iconic Travel & Tours (GL #5247)"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection guidelines for pilgrims and clients of Iconic Travel & Tours (GL #5247)."
>

  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-emerald text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold">Legal Document</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-ivory/80">Draft Policy — Subject to ongoing client and legal governance</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-ivory">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-brand-gold/25 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs">
        <strong>Notice for Client & Legal Review:</strong> This privacy policy is an editable draft prepared for Iconic Travel & Tours (GL #5247) and reflects standard international data processing standards for tourism operators.
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Iconic Travel & Tours ("we", "our", or "the Company"), licensed under Government License GL #5247 and situated at Office #502, Iconic Business Center, Sharfabad, Karachi, Pakistan, is committed to safeguarding the privacy and personal information of our pilgrims, travelers, and website visitors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>In order to facilitate Saudi Umrah visas, flight bookings, and hotel reservations, we may collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-brand-charcoal-muted">
          <li>Full name, passport biodata, national identity card (CNIC) details, and photographs.</li>
          <li>Contact details including phone numbers, physical addresses, and email addresses.</li>
          <li>Flight preferences, room occupancy requests, and dietary or wheelchair needs.</li>
          <li>Payment verification details and banking deposit receipts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">3. Purpose of Processing</h2>
        <p>Your personal information is used exclusively for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-brand-charcoal-muted">
          <li>Issuing official Saudi Umrah and tourist visas through authorized government channels (e.g. Nusuk / Enjaz).</li>
          <li>Confirming airline tickets with accredited carriers.</li>
          <li>Confirming hotel vouchers and intercity transportation in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.</li>
          <li>Communicating itinerary updates, prayer schedules, and emergency alerts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">4. Disclosure to Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
          We never sell, rent, or trade customer information to external marketing agencies. Data is shared strictly with regulatory authorities (Ministry of Hajj & Umrah, Department of Tourist Services, civil aviation bodies) and vetted hospitality providers solely to deliver your contracted pilgrimage arrangements.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">5. Data Retention & Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement rigorous administrative, physical, and digital safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure of pilgrim documentation. Records are retained strictly as required by Pakistani corporate laws and Saudi visa regulations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-brand-emerald">6. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For inquiries regarding this policy or to request updates to your personal records, contact our privacy desk at:
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-emerald">
          Iconic Travel & Tours<br />
          Office #502, Iconic Business Center, Sharfabad, Karachi, Pakistan.<br />
          Email: inquiry@iconictravelandtours.com • Phone: +92-332-2177752
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
